<div class="hero-container hero-container-2">
        <div class="hero-main-wrapper">
            <picture class="hero-picture white-overlay">
                <img src="{{'landingpage2-hero-img.png' | file_img_url:'master'}}" alt="Office furniture matters" />
            </picture>
            <div class="page-width">
                <div class="hero-text">
                    <h1 class="h1-style">Office <br>furniture <br>matters<span>.</span></h1>
                    <ul class="disc-number-bullets disc-number-bullets-2">
                        <li>Happy people</li>
                        <li>Increased productivity</li>
                        <li>Encourages collaboration</li>
                        <li>Enhances your brand identity</li>
                        <li>We'll help you achieve all of that</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a class="typeform-share getaquoteclick button button-secondary" {{ settings.typeformurls_url_1 }} href="javascript:void(0)">
                        Get a quote
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="page-width hero-column-wrapper">
        <div class="hero-column">
            <div class="hero-column-left">
<p>We know how much a great working environment can make a difference, to the people working to achieve your business goals.</p>

<p>That's why we value your business and personnel needs, and tailor-fit offices that will increase productivity and create a winning culture within your organisation.</p>

<p>5000+ products, a free floor plan and a dedicated project manager means you are covered at every point. We even deliver and assemble it all. With you every step of the way.</p>

            </div>
            <div class="hero-column-right">
                <div class="img-holder">
<img src="{{'chair-plant2.png' | file_img_url : 'master'}}" alt="Office furniture matters 2" />
                </div>
                
                <div id="typeform-rvv9MINp-1" class="typeform-snippet typeform-share typeform-embed" data-tf-widget="rvv9MINp" data-tf-on-ready="ready" data-tf-iframe-props="title=JasonL - Get A Quote - Inbound" data-tf-medium="snippet" data-tf-hidden="" style="width:390px;height:470px;"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
       
    </div>
</div>

